' The main program.  Shows the title screen and reads the tables, then makes one character after another: rolls
' the abilities (roll_abilities), chooses sex, race and class (choose_race_and_class), alignment and the rest
' (choose_alignment), and shows the result (show_character_summary).
' The player may buy the character's equipment (visit_equipment_store), keep the character and print a character
' sheet (print_character_sheet), and then make another one or quit.  alert_answer% holds each alert answer;
' THINK waits three seconds and asks again.
Cls  ! clear the screen
Hidem  ! hide the mouse pointer
@Show_title_screen  ! title screen, then read all the tables from the DATA
Void Fre(0)  ! tidy up the string memory
Do
  @Roll_abilities  ! roll the six abilities, comeliness and social class until the player keeps them
  @Choose_race_and_class  ! choose sex, race, class and work out the ability bonuses
  @Choose_alignment  ! choose alignment, then hit points, age, money and the rest
  @Show_character_summary  ! show the new character
  Ask_buy_equipment:
  Work_text$="Do you want this character|enough to buy their supplies|and equipment?"  ! ask whether the character is worth equipping
  Alert 0,Work_text$,3," YES | NO | THINK ",Alert_answer%
  If Alert_answer%=1  ! the player answered YES
    @Visit_equipment_store  ! go shopping in the price lists
  Endif
  If Alert_answer%=2  ! the player answered NO
  Else
    If Alert_answer%=3  ! the player answered THINK
      Pause 150  ! wait three seconds, then ask again
      Goto Ask_buy_equipment
    Endif
    @Show_character_summary  ! show the character again after shopping
    Ask_keep_character:
    Work_text$=" DO YOU WANT THIS CHARACTER? | |"  ! ask whether to keep the character
    Work_text$=Work_text$+"A 'YES' response at this time|will print a character sheet."
    Alert 0,Work_text$,3," YES | NO | THINK ",Alert_answer%
    If Alert_answer%=1  ! YES: keep it
      @Print_character_sheet  ! print the full character sheet
    Endif
    If Alert_answer%=3  ! THINK
      Pause 150  ! wait three seconds, then ask again
      Goto Ask_keep_character
    Endif
  Endif
  Alert 2,"Do you want another|character?",1," YES | NO ",Alert_answer%  ! ask whether to make another character
  Exit If Alert_answer%=2  ! NO: leave the main loop
Loop  ! back for the next character
Cls  ! clear the screen before leaving
End  ! end of the program
' Races, read by Restore at start-up into race_names$, race_ability_limits%, race_percentile_limit%.
' First the number of races (race%, 17).  Then one record per race:
'   name, padded with spaces (trailing spaces removed, into race_names$(race))
'   6 pairs of minimum, maximum, in ability order Strength, Intelligence, Wisdom, Dexterity, Constitution,
'     Charisma (race_ability_limits%(race,ability,1,sex) and race_ability_limits%(race,ability,2,sex), copied to
' both sexes)
'   female Strength maximum (race_ability_limits%(race,1,2,2), replaces the copied value)
'   female and male maximum exceptional Strength percentage, 00 = none (race_percentile_limit%(race,2),
' race_percentile_limit%(race,1))
Data 17,"Gray Dwarf    ",08,18,03,18,03,18
Data 03,17,11,19,04,16,17,00
