Data 1,0,0,1,1,1,1,1
Data "Neutral Good   ",1,0,1,0,1,1,1
Data 1,1,0,0,0,"True Neutral   ",0,0
Data 1,1,1,1,0,1,1,1
Data 0,0,"Neutral Evil   ",0,0,1,0,1
Data 1,0,1,1,1,1,0,"Chaotic Good   "
Data 1,0,1,0,1,1,1,1
Data 1,0,0,0,Chaotic Neutral,0,0,1
Data 0,1,1,0,1,1,1,0
Data 0,"Chaotic Evil   ",0,0,1,0,1,1
Data 0,1,1,1,1,0
' The seven ability names, read into ability_names$(1..7): Strength, Intelligence, Wisdom, Dexterity,
' Constitution,
' Charisma, Comeliness.  The other tables give ability values in this order.
Data_ability_names:
Data Strength,Intelligence,Wisdom,Dexterity,Constitution,Charisma,Comeliness
' Age categories, read into age_category_names$ and race_age_ranges%.
