' Social classes, read into social_class_names$: first the count (social_class%, 9), then the names from Lower
' Lower to
' Upper Upper.
Data_social_class_names:
Data 9,Lower Lower,Middle Lower,Upper Lower,Lower Middle,Middle Middle,Upper Middle,Lower Upper
Data Middle Upper,Upper Upper
' First-level cleric spells, read into cleric_spells$: first the count (cleric_spell_count%, 20), then the spell
' names.
' A * marks a spell from the Unearthed Arcana.
Data_cleric_spells:
Data 20,Bless,Ceremony*,Combine*,Command,Create Water,Cure Light Wounds,Detect Evil
Data Detect Magic,Endure Cold/Heat*,Invisibility to Undead*,Light,Magic Stone*,Penetrate Disguise*,Portent*,Precipitation*
Data Protection from Evil,Purify Food and Drink,Remove Fear,Resist Cold,Sanctuary
' Turning undead at first level, read into undead_names$ and undead_turning_table%: first the count (5), then
' for each undead
' type its name (undead_names$(n)) and the d20 roll a first-level cleric needs to turn it
' (undead_turning_table%(n)).
Data_turn_undead_table:
Data 5,Skeleton,10,Zombie,13,Ghoul,16,Shadow
Data 19,Wight,20
' First-level druid spells, read into druid_spells$: first the count (druid_spell_count%, 16), then the spell
' names.
' A * marks a spell from the Unearthed Arcana.
Data_druid_spells:
Data 16,Animal Friendship,Ceremony*,Detect Balance*,Detect Magic,Detect Poison*,Detect Snares & Pits,Entangle
Data Faerie Fire,Invisibility to Animals,Locate Animals,Pass Without Trace,Precipitation*,Predict Weather,Purify Water,Shillelagh
Data Speak With Animals
' First-level magic-user spells, read into magic_user_spells$(spell,group): first the number of groups
' (outer_count%, 3) and
' the number of spells in each (inner_count%, 11), then the names group by group: offensive, defensive,
' miscellaneous.  A * marks a spell from the Unearthed Arcana.
Data_magic_user_spells:
Data 3,11,Burning Hands,Charm Person,Enlarge,Firewater*,Friends,Grease*
Data Light,Magic Missile,Push,Shocking Grasp,Sleep,Armor*,Affect Normal Fires,Dancing Lights
Data Feather Fall,Hold Portal,Jump,Protection From Evil,Run*,Shield,Spider Climb,Ventriloquism
Data Comprehend Languages,Detect Magic,Erase,Find Familiar,Identify,Mending,Message,Mount*
Data Unseen Servant,Wizard Mark*,Write
' First-level illusionist spells, read into illusionist_spells$(spell,group): first the number of groups
' (outer_count%, 3) and
' the number of spells in each (inner_count%, 6), then the names group by group: offensive, defensive,
' miscellaneous.  Empty strings fill the unused places.  A * marks a spell from the Unearthed Arcana.
Data_illusionist_spells:
Data 3,6,Color Spray,Hypnotism,Light,Phantasmal Force,Chromatic Orb*,Spook*
Data Audible Glamer,Darkness,Gaze Reflection,Wall of Fog,Phantom Armor*,,Change Self,Dancing Lights
Data Detect Illusion,Detect Invisibility,,
' The eight thief skill names, read into thief_skill_names$(1..8) after the Dexterity table.
Data_thief_skill_names:
Data Pick Pockets,Open Locks,Find/Remove Traps,Move Silently,Hide in Shadows,Hear Noise,Climb Walls,Read Languages
' Coin names, read into coin_names$: first the count (4), then Gold, Electrum, Silver, Copper.  Every price
